    // objc_getClass/sel_registerName/objc_msgSend); mac.appkit/mac.quartz carry
    // no direct C grants (Aqua via the objc bridge; framework LC_LOAD_DYLIBs
    // are future desktop work, degraded-headless in v1). No public mac.*
    // module initially (std-internal, mirroring how Linux started). Tables are
    // re-derived for Darwin (never copied Linux values); Linux-only spellings
    // (getrandom/fork/execve/gettid/sysinfo) are ABSENT by design (s9).
    // UNGATED: helpers exist on all targets, never CALLED on Win64/SysV paths.
